docs {
  # getGatewayVersion

  Get Gateway HW/SW versions.

  ## Required service level

  `none`

  ## Body

  `none`

  ## Response

  `200 OK` (Version)

  ### Example

  ```json
  {
	"HwVersion": "0.1.0.0",
	"SwVersion": "1.0.5"
  }
  ```
}

